WEBVTT

00:01.150 --> 00:04.490
Rumors of the Kingdom of Barcula

00:04.490 --> 00:07.320
using magical devices to purify their sewage

00:07.320 --> 00:09.800
have reached our lands of Sidonia.

00:10.090 --> 00:13.440
The Church of Divine Light 
has issued an appeal

00:13.440 --> 00:17.280
to the Holy Empire of Sidonia's 
Pope on this matter.

00:17.690 --> 00:23.000
They claim that light magic is a gift from 
God bestowed upon the Church of Divine Light,

00:23.460 --> 00:26.360
and, as such, purification magic

00:26.360 --> 00:29.360
falls under the purview
of the Church of Divine Light.

00:29.360 --> 00:30.470
What does this mean?

00:32.010 --> 00:34.940
They have said, "The purification 
magic circle and its patent"

00:34.940 --> 00:37.770
"are to be turned over to the Church."

00:38.750 --> 00:41.830
If the power is a gift from their god,

00:41.830 --> 00:45.600
then the Church can just make 
the magic circle themselves.

00:46.560 --> 00:49.500
Th-The Pope has also added,

00:49.500 --> 00:54.950
"Using our sacred purification magic on a 
magical toilet is inexcusable."

00:54.950 --> 00:58.460
Therefore, "You are to 
promptly turn over the one"

00:58.460 --> 01:03.560
"who created this purifying magical device
 to the Holy Empire of Sidonia."

01:03.560 --> 01:04.920
I refuse.

01:05.880 --> 01:11.040
The Pope is considering recalling all 
of the Church of Divine Light's priests

01:11.040 --> 01:13.690
who reside in the Kingdom of Barcula!

01:13.690 --> 01:16.960
Please, by all means, recall them.

01:18.420 --> 01:22.080
We shall not stop you.

02:54.480 --> 02:59.490
<b>Episode 6
A Drake Horse Appears</b>

02:54.480 --> 02:59.490
<b>Episode 6
A Drake Horse Appears</b>

02:54.700 --> 02:56.890
Was that really okay...

02:57.120 --> 03:01.350
to take such a hard stance 
with Sidonia's messenger?

03:01.350 --> 03:03.460
It's not a problem.

03:03.460 --> 03:07.060
But doesn't that mean turning 
the Church against us?

03:07.060 --> 03:11.840
Mr. Takumi, you might not know this 
since you're from a rural town,

03:11.840 --> 03:16.640
but there's another religion aside from the 
Church of Divine Light in this kingdom.

03:16.640 --> 03:20.100
Oh, the Church of Creation, right?

03:20.100 --> 03:21.770
Oh? I'm surprised you know about it.

03:21.770 --> 03:25.720
Yes, the Church of Creation that 
worships the Goddess Nolyn.

03:25.720 --> 03:30.630
Um, if the Church of Creation 
worships Lady Nolyn,

03:30.630 --> 03:33.440
then what god does the 
Church of Divine Light worship?

03:33.440 --> 03:37.410
I believe that would be Anat.

03:37.410 --> 03:38.830
Anat?

03:38.830 --> 03:43.810
Setting that aside, the Kingdom of Barcula 
upholds freedom of religion,

03:43.810 --> 03:47.400
so it has many believers in the 
long-standing Church of Creation.

03:47.680 --> 03:51.890
For one thing, the Church of Creation's 
priests administer recovery magic

03:51.890 --> 03:54.570
for little more than a show of appreciation.

03:54.830 --> 04:00.440
And in contrast, the priests of the Church of
 Divine Light charge hefty fees, I take it?

04:00.440 --> 04:01.290
Yes.

04:01.560 --> 04:06.990
And the Church of Divine Light is bring propped up 
by the Holy Empire of Sidonia, right?

04:06.990 --> 04:13.080
So, what brings me here today is 
a request for you, Mr. Takumi.

04:07.340 --> 04:10.140
<i>It would be wise to avoid 
getting involved with them.</i>

04:13.530 --> 04:14.640
A request?

04:14.640 --> 04:15.840
Well...

04:15.840 --> 04:19.400
I went through our lord, Marquis Godwin,

04:19.400 --> 04:21.810
to offer His Royal Majesty 
samples of your toilet

04:21.810 --> 04:24.750
with its purification magic,
as well as your refrigerator,

04:24.750 --> 04:26.340
so, well...

04:27.090 --> 04:33.030
He's ordered that the Marquis and
 I shall bring you to meet him!

04:33.030 --> 04:35.170
H-Hold on a minute!

04:35.170 --> 04:40.120
Of course, His Royal Majesty will 
not be angry if you refuse!

04:40.120 --> 04:43.730
So it's up to you, Mr. Takumi!

04:43.730 --> 04:47.680
To the royal capital, Bakilatos?

04:47.680 --> 04:48.900
Yes.

04:48.900 --> 04:54.520
His Royal Majesty has protected me from the 
Holy Empire of Sidonia's interference,

04:54.520 --> 04:57.320
so it seemed rude to refuse.

04:57.320 --> 05:00.030
Could I ask you two to come with me?

05:00.030 --> 05:01.240
Of course.

05:01.240 --> 05:04.260
It's my first time visiting 
the royal capital!

05:04.260 --> 05:06.790
Have you been before, Sofia?

05:06.790 --> 05:09.250
No, it will be a first for me, too.

05:09.250 --> 05:11.740
It's a first for me, too!

05:12.220 --> 05:14.340
We'll be heading out in a week.

05:14.340 --> 05:17.570
We'll need to get a lot of 
things ready in the meantime.

05:17.840 --> 05:20.810
How long does it take to 
reach the royal capital?

05:20.810 --> 05:23.870
They said it's about seven days 
by monster horse carriage.

05:23.870 --> 05:28.430
Then I'll need to prepare 
plenty of food, too!

05:28.760 --> 05:30.520
I'll leave that to you, Maria.

05:30.520 --> 05:33.980
Leave all the housework to me!

05:33.980 --> 05:37.770
Also, I'm thinking of making 
new cloaks for you two.

05:37.770 --> 05:39.840
Cloaks?

05:40.440 --> 05:44.810
I had Papek secure some 
dark element magical stones for me.

05:45.100 --> 05:48.910
With those, I can enchant 
the cloaks with Block Perception.

05:48.910 --> 05:51.000
Block Perception...

05:51.000 --> 05:53.610
That would certainly be useful in combat.

05:54.230 --> 05:56.690
Also, if you wear them in town,

05:56.690 --> 06:01.450
then I think it'll help you two 
avoid being accosted by bad people.

06:01.800 --> 06:03.540
You know...

06:03.540 --> 06:07.690
I think Mr. Takumi isn't valuing 
himself highly enough.

06:07.690 --> 06:09.170
I agree.

06:09.170 --> 06:10.700
He has good looks to start with,

06:10.700 --> 06:14.300
and then there's his talent and 
strong capability as a producer.

06:14.300 --> 06:16.430
Add onto that his disposition, and—

06:16.860 --> 06:17.850
Wh-What?

06:17.850 --> 06:19.810
Oh-ho...

06:20.580 --> 06:24.820
I-I'm just stating why he's 
wonderful as a master!

06:24.820 --> 06:27.420
Sure, sure.

06:27.420 --> 06:31.160
H-Hey! There's Black Buffalo
 meat over there!

06:31.370 --> 06:34.740
Sofia, you're so love-struck!

06:42.260 --> 06:45.230
Where's your offering?

06:47.180 --> 06:48.550
Lady Nolyn.

06:48.550 --> 06:50.220
Hey, Takumi!

06:50.220 --> 06:51.420
It's been a while.

06:51.420 --> 06:53.590
I hear you're heading to the royal capital.

06:53.590 --> 06:56.130
Are you here to pray for safe travels?

06:56.330 --> 06:58.900
And you didn't bring an offering?

06:58.900 --> 07:00.750
I have some questions.

07:01.240 --> 07:04.710
The goddess of the Church of 
Divine Light is called Anat, right?

07:04.710 --> 07:05.740
That's right.

07:05.740 --> 07:11.570
Is she a goddess separate from you?

07:11.840 --> 07:14.790
Ugh. I'm the <i>only</i> goddess.

07:14.790 --> 07:17.410
Then who is Anat?

07:17.410 --> 07:20.120
Well, you'll learn that in due time.

07:20.120 --> 07:21.560
In due time?

07:21.560 --> 07:22.630
What's this?

07:22.630 --> 07:23.850
Are you curious?

07:24.320 --> 07:30.420
It feels like the Holy Empire of Sidonia
 has been drawing closer to me.

07:30.420 --> 07:36.630
You mentioned before that some of your blessing 
would come undone depending on my actions.

07:36.630 --> 07:37.250
Yeah.

07:37.250 --> 07:40.810
Was the interference from 
Sidonia because of that?

07:40.810 --> 07:42.240
It wasn't.

07:42.240 --> 07:47.030
Sidonia is the reason that you're 
here in Mildgard in the first place.

07:47.030 --> 07:49.530
So that goes beyond the level 
of a blessing's power.

07:49.530 --> 07:51.460
I see.

07:51.460 --> 07:56.240
Oh, so what's become of the 
heroes summoned by Sidonia?

07:56.240 --> 07:59.700
Normally that would cause 
quite the commotion.

07:59.700 --> 08:01.400
The truth is...

08:01.400 --> 08:05.110
I messed with time when 
I sent you on your way.

08:05.110 --> 08:08.190
I sent you to one year before
 the summoning of the heroes.

08:08.190 --> 08:08.890
Huh?!

08:08.890 --> 08:12.360
You mean they haven't 
been summoned yet?!

08:12.360 --> 08:15.300
Yeah. Not for another few months.

08:15.300 --> 08:16.640
Hold on a minute!

08:16.640 --> 08:19.150
Why go to the trouble of sending me
 a year before the summoning?!

08:19.150 --> 08:20.820
Time's up, Iruma.

08:20.820 --> 08:23.890
This isn't visiting hours at a prison.

08:24.180 --> 08:25.710
Well, see you later!

08:25.710 --> 08:27.730
Next time, bring an offering!

08:27.730 --> 08:29.470
I like sweets!

08:29.470 --> 08:32.160
Wait, you haven't answered my question—

08:37.490 --> 08:41.200
<i>I feel like she dodged the question.</i>

08:41.470 --> 08:44.990
<i>Well, I'm not planning 
on meeting the heroes,</i>

08:44.990 --> 08:46.440
<i>so I guess it doesn't matter to me.</i>

08:46.790 --> 08:50.800
<b>Holy Empire of Sidonia
10 Months After Takumi's Present Time</b>

08:48.630 --> 08:51.020
That's it, Sir Akira!

08:52.770 --> 08:54.360
Wonderful!

08:54.360 --> 08:58.980
If I were one second slower, 
I would have lost my life.

08:58.980 --> 09:01.000
You're quite the flatterer.

09:01.000 --> 09:02.470
No, no.

09:02.470 --> 09:07.050
The growth you've achieved in these past 
few weeks has been astonishing, Sir Akira.

09:09.980 --> 09:17.200
<b>Presence Concealing
Cloak</b>

09:09.980 --> 09:17.200
m 0 0 l 150 0 150 12 0 12

09:09.980 --> 09:17.200
<b>Cloak created from from
cloth woven from mythril
and an Arachne's
special silk.</b>

09:09.980 --> 09:17.200
m 0 0 l 150 0 150 26 0 26

09:09.980 --> 09:17.200
<b>Enchantments</b>

09:09.980 --> 09:17.200
m 0 0 l 65 0 65 6 0 6

09:09.980 --> 09:17.200
<b><b>• Block Perception
• Enhanced Stealth
• Enhanced Physical
Resistance
• Auto Temperature Regulation</b></b>

09:09.980 --> 09:17.200
m 0 0 l 120 0 120 21 0 21

09:09.990 --> 09:12.220
Wow!

09:17.180 --> 09:19.030
They match Master's!

09:19.030 --> 09:21.670
That's far too brazen.

09:21.670 --> 09:24.870
Huh? You don't like the design?

09:24.870 --> 09:27.220
No, I do like it!

09:27.220 --> 09:28.590
They're lovely!

09:28.880 --> 09:30.420
Then I'm glad to hear it.

09:30.420 --> 09:33.300
You two look good no matter 
what you wear.

09:33.300 --> 09:36.040
No, no, now you're going too far!

09:37.480 --> 09:40.230
<i>Did I say something inappropriate again?!</i>

09:40.820 --> 09:42.710
Huh?!

09:42.960 --> 09:45.690
You're <i>making</i> a carriage?!

09:45.690 --> 09:47.690
Thinking long-term,

09:48.000 --> 09:52.640
I figure it's better to build a comfortable one
 for myself instead of borrowing one every time.

09:52.910 --> 09:56.090
I can make the carriage, 
but we don't have a monster horse.

09:56.090 --> 09:58.610
I'll just have to borrow 
one from the guild.

10:00.120 --> 10:01.720
Mr. Takumi.

10:01.720 --> 10:07.340
Do you know why Bolton is called 
the "Town of Adventurers"?

10:07.340 --> 10:08.320
No...

10:08.320 --> 10:11.710
It's actually my first time 
learning that it's called that.

10:14.710 --> 10:19.390
I can't believe I assumed you 
knew something when you didn't!

10:20.080 --> 10:24.890
I'm just a chilly toilet pretending 
to be a refrigerator!

10:25.210 --> 10:27.140
Another toilet metaphor?

10:27.140 --> 10:29.590
So, why is it called that?

10:29.590 --> 10:32.390
Remember the Forest of Death outside Bolton?

10:32.390 --> 10:34.900
There are many other areas 
like that monsters inhabit.

10:34.900 --> 10:38.460
There are even unicorns and drake horses, 
which compared to monster horses,

10:38.460 --> 10:40.150
are far faster and stronger!

10:40.150 --> 10:42.360
I hear there are griffons, too!

10:52.210 --> 10:55.630
Are drake horses significantly 
faster than monster horses?

10:55.630 --> 10:56.500
Yes.

10:56.500 --> 10:58.660
They possess far greater speed and stamina

10:58.660 --> 11:01.170
than monster horses, plus they're tough.

11:01.170 --> 11:04.180
Is that because they're a 
type of dragon monster?

11:04.180 --> 11:06.470
No, they're not dragon monsters.

11:06.470 --> 11:08.640
They apparently look pretty much
 like ordinary horses.

11:08.640 --> 11:12.690
The distinct difference between them 
and horses is their rhino-like horn,

11:12.690 --> 11:16.330
and the fact that their bodies are 
covered in scales like a dragon.

11:16.820 --> 11:18.080
I see.

11:18.080 --> 11:19.440
So that's where the name comes from.

11:19.440 --> 11:23.410
Master, Sofia, Maria!

11:23.410 --> 11:25.480
Hurry, hurry!

11:25.820 --> 11:27.870
Maple's really excited.

11:27.870 --> 11:31.520
Maybe she's happy that she 
might get another like her.

11:31.520 --> 11:34.080
Huh?! Maple!

11:34.080 --> 11:37.310
Don't you already have me?!

11:40.670 --> 11:42.010
A Bush Wolf!

11:43.420 --> 11:46.060
Huh? It passed right by us.

11:46.060 --> 11:48.640
It's thanks to our cloaks' Block Perception!

11:48.640 --> 11:53.560
If they can deceive a Bush Wolf's nose, 
then these cloaks are really good.

11:53.990 --> 11:56.380
That's true. Although...

11:57.030 --> 11:58.010
Huh?!

11:58.010 --> 12:03.620
It might be to remove the cloaks 
and fight in order for us to train.

12:03.620 --> 12:07.430
<i>Ah, her weird switch has flipped again.</i>

12:11.550 --> 12:14.020
Wow. In one blow.

12:14.020 --> 12:16.130
We got some extra meat!

12:16.130 --> 12:19.960
I can dry the meat and it to our supplies!

12:19.960 --> 12:22.090
Let's hurry up!

12:22.090 --> 12:23.200
Yeah.

12:24.300 --> 12:26.020
That's a Treant.

12:26.020 --> 12:27.770
It's dead.

12:27.770 --> 12:30.320
It's okay to take this, right?

12:30.760 --> 12:33.910
We need Treant wood to make the carriage.

12:33.910 --> 12:36.850
I was thinking of buying 
some from Papek, but...

12:36.850 --> 12:41.230
A Treant this big will provide 
enough wood for the whole carriage.

12:41.230 --> 12:42.520
I'll help you.

12:42.520 --> 12:44.450
Master!

12:44.450 --> 12:46.890
Meat, meat!

12:46.890 --> 12:51.070
Wood, wood!

12:51.370 --> 12:54.540
Jeez, I'm going on ahead.

12:59.890 --> 13:03.850
There are lots of tree monsters on the ground.

13:04.970 --> 13:06.500
Is something there?

13:13.070 --> 13:14.420
Wow!

13:22.220 --> 13:25.310
Are you injured?

13:46.320 --> 13:50.340
I'm Maple. I have an amazing master.

13:50.340 --> 13:52.230
He'll heal you.

13:58.180 --> 14:00.210
Did these things hurt you?

14:07.050 --> 14:09.840
Wait here. I'll call my master.

14:11.330 --> 14:13.330
Stay away!

14:28.460 --> 14:30.790
<i>Master! Master!</i>

14:33.130 --> 14:35.640
<i>Why isn't he responding?!</i>

14:36.280 --> 14:39.180
<i>Master was so focused on those trees.</i>

14:39.850 --> 14:42.290
<i>They all... They all...</i>

14:42.290 --> 14:44.090
<i>I'm sure...</i>

14:44.090 --> 14:47.340
<i>they all forgot about me and went home.</i>

14:59.890 --> 15:01.250
Master...

15:02.570 --> 15:05.600
Master... you dummy.

15:06.660 --> 15:09.550
Stupid master!

15:13.450 --> 15:15.880
<i>I... can't!</i>

15:26.280 --> 15:27.410
Master?

15:27.810 --> 15:28.800
Maple.

15:29.660 --> 15:31.780
Master!

15:33.140 --> 15:34.730
You did well.

15:35.340 --> 15:37.190
Master!

15:37.460 --> 15:38.850
I'm glad you're safe.

15:38.850 --> 15:40.290
Maple!

15:40.290 --> 15:41.640
Everyone!

15:41.640 --> 15:43.090
I called for you!

15:43.090 --> 15:45.730
I called for you, Master!

15:45.730 --> 15:46.750
I'm sorry.

15:47.170 --> 15:48.460
This was in the way.

15:48.460 --> 15:52.680
While weaving these threads into multiple 
layers created a sturdy defense,

15:52.680 --> 15:54.890
they seem to have blocked mana as well.

15:55.320 --> 15:59.150
I figured something was wrong the
moment I felt our mana link drop,

15:59.150 --> 16:00.980
so I followed the trail it left.

16:01.950 --> 16:03.340
Sorry I was late.

16:03.340 --> 16:04.620
You must have been scared.

16:04.620 --> 16:06.550
Master!

16:06.550 --> 16:08.230
Th-This girl...

16:08.230 --> 16:11.790
She's a drake horse, isn't she?

16:11.790 --> 16:14.070
She must have passed out 
from her serious wounds.

16:11.990 --> 16:14.070
<b>Drake Horse</b>

16:11.990 --> 16:14.070
<b>Condition</b>

16:11.990 --> 16:14.070
<b>Severely Wounded
Unconscious</b>

16:14.530 --> 16:16.760
Please, Master!

16:16.760 --> 16:18.950
You <i>have</i> to save her!

16:18.950 --> 16:20.060
I see.

16:20.060 --> 16:22.390
You were trying to protect her, huh?

16:22.390 --> 16:23.410
Alright.

16:27.130 --> 16:28.490
She repelled me?!

16:28.490 --> 16:32.300
Maybe's she's just that wary 
even while unconscious.

16:32.300 --> 16:33.330
No way!

16:33.330 --> 16:34.770
She's going to die!

16:35.750 --> 16:37.930
I sense other monsters approaching.

16:37.930 --> 16:39.390
Staying here much longer is dangerous.

16:39.390 --> 16:43.050
Master! Don't leave her behind! Please!

16:43.050 --> 16:44.040
Don't worry.

16:44.040 --> 16:45.360
I'm not leaving her behind.

16:47.380 --> 16:49.600
You're putting her in 
your pocket dimension?!

16:49.600 --> 16:52.730
Maple, stay with her until I call for you.

16:53.000 --> 16:53.790
Okay!

16:55.720 --> 16:57.110
That's reckless!

16:57.110 --> 17:00.400
You can't put an advanced monster 
in there without a familiar pact!

17:00.400 --> 17:04.940
Doing so will put intense 
strain on your body!

17:04.940 --> 17:08.760
I-It's fine, it's fine...

17:10.030 --> 17:16.100
I'll drink a potion and recover.

17:17.350 --> 17:18.870
Mr. Takumi!

17:21.650 --> 17:24.890
It's been over twelve hours 
and he still hasn't woken.

17:24.890 --> 17:26.350
Of course not.

17:26.690 --> 17:28.160
Even though he's asleep,

17:28.160 --> 17:31.810
he's still maintaining that pocket 
dimension despite its high strain.

17:32.030 --> 17:34.790
Maple isn't coming out, either.

17:34.790 --> 17:38.240
That's probably because
Mr. Takumi hasn't summoned her,

17:38.240 --> 17:40.340
and the drake horse is still frightened.

17:40.930 --> 17:42.810
Unless Maple opens it,

17:42.810 --> 17:45.740
the pocket dimension will keep 
holding that drake horse,

17:45.740 --> 17:48.430
and Mr. Takumi will slowly wither away.

17:49.440 --> 17:51.130
We have to do something.

17:51.460 --> 17:52.860
Like what?

17:52.860 --> 17:54.650
Before he withers away...

17:58.420 --> 18:00.130
Sofia?!

18:00.690 --> 18:02.930
<i>Follow Mr. Takumi's mana, and...</i>

18:03.420 --> 18:04.390
<i>Maple?</i>

18:06.100 --> 18:08.770
<i>Maple, can you hear me?</i>

18:08.770 --> 18:10.140
<i>Maple!</i>

18:10.140 --> 18:11.600
Sofia?

18:11.600 --> 18:13.370
<i>How is she?</i>

18:13.370 --> 18:16.320
She's still frightened.

18:16.320 --> 18:18.430
<i>Can you get her out of there?</i>

18:18.430 --> 18:21.890
She might become more confused if she 
suddenly pops out somewhere unfamiliar.

18:22.400 --> 18:26.380
<i>Still, we can't heal her 
if she doesn't come out.</i>

18:26.380 --> 18:29.030
<i>Mr. Takumi will remain unconscious, too.</i>

18:29.440 --> 18:30.490
Yeah.

18:30.490 --> 18:34.160
<i>Can you make the same barrier of 
thread you used in the forest?</i>

18:34.160 --> 18:37.770
<i>The drake horse's fears may be 
assuaged if she can't see past it.</i>

18:38.600 --> 18:40.940
Oh, right.

18:40.940 --> 18:42.120
Got it!

18:43.380 --> 18:44.570
<i>I'll do it!</i>

18:44.570 --> 18:46.260
<i>I'll take her out in the garden!</i>

18:47.950 --> 18:49.200
Sofia?

18:49.200 --> 18:50.500
Where are you going?

18:50.500 --> 18:52.020
The Papek Company.

18:52.710 --> 18:54.750
I'll buy some medicinal 
herbs for monsters.

18:54.750 --> 18:57.400
Please let me handle that errand!

18:57.400 --> 19:03.230
Sofia, please stay with Mr. Takumi 
so you're here when he wakes!

19:03.230 --> 19:04.740
I'm heading off!

19:08.730 --> 19:12.730
<i>Ah, that's warm.</i>

19:13.150 --> 19:14.670
<i>Mr. Takumi.</i>

19:15.170 --> 19:17.030
<i>Please wake up already.</i>

19:18.020 --> 19:21.170
<i>I've prepared delicious soup for you!</i>

19:21.170 --> 19:24.570
<i>Master! You sleepyhead!</i>

19:24.570 --> 19:26.620
<i>Oh... yeah.</i>

19:27.160 --> 19:28.550
<i>I need to wake up.</i>

19:35.080 --> 19:36.990
<i>That warmth...</i>

19:43.610 --> 19:46.150
Mr. Takumi!

19:46.150 --> 19:47.310
Good morning.

19:47.720 --> 19:50.130
It sounds like you've all 
been doing your best.

19:50.130 --> 19:53.620
I'm glad I have you all.

19:54.330 --> 19:57.170
Now, I need to go see to that drake horse.

19:58.960 --> 20:01.510
Master, come in!

20:06.730 --> 20:08.810
He's the one I've been telling you about.

20:08.810 --> 20:10.690
The one who'll save you.

20:10.690 --> 20:12.720
<i>She's recovered quite a bit.</i>

20:12.720 --> 20:16.040
<i>Maple did her best to treat her.</i>

20:16.040 --> 20:17.050
<i>In that case...</i>

20:17.620 --> 20:20.060
It looks like you and Maple 
are good friends now.

20:20.060 --> 20:22.750
Would you like to be my friend, too?

20:22.750 --> 20:24.110
Please.

20:26.830 --> 20:29.750
<b>Tame <b>Drake Horse?</b></b>

20:35.270 --> 20:37.280
<b>Drake Horse</b>

20:35.270 --> 20:37.280
<b>tamed</b>

20:36.000 --> 20:37.300
Master?

20:37.730 --> 20:38.740
There!

20:41.930 --> 20:43.640
<i>High Heal!</i>

21:02.520 --> 21:04.810
Thanks to all the hard work
you all put in,

21:05.280 --> 21:07.440
we have a new companion.

21:07.690 --> 21:10.440
Master, what about her name?

21:10.440 --> 21:11.760
Let's see...

21:11.760 --> 21:15.140
I named you Maple because 
the pattern on your abdomen

21:15.140 --> 21:17.090
resembles a maple leaf, didn't I?

21:17.890 --> 21:21.200
Then name her after a leaf, too!

21:26.960 --> 21:28.010
Camellia.

21:28.010 --> 21:29.340
Camellia?

21:29.340 --> 21:30.130
Yeah.

21:30.130 --> 21:32.480
It's a tree that retains 
its leaves all year round,

21:32.790 --> 21:35.310
and it blooms with
red and white flowers.

21:35.650 --> 21:37.770
What a lovely name!

21:37.770 --> 21:38.660
Yeah.

21:38.660 --> 21:41.160
Camellia! Good for you!

21:41.710 --> 21:45.210
You know, I was so lonely when I was 
injured and all alone in the forest.

21:45.210 --> 21:47.120
I was sad and scared...

21:47.120 --> 21:49.010
But then Master rescued me...

21:49.010 --> 21:51.600
Then I was really, really happy!

21:51.600 --> 21:54.030
So I wanted to help you.

21:54.030 --> 21:56.420
Okay! Let's have some food!

21:56.730 --> 21:59.590
I just finished making something delicious!

21:59.590 --> 22:02.300
I'm starving!

22:02.300 --> 22:04.820
That's because you haven't
eaten for a full day.

22:04.820 --> 22:07.640
I'm hungry, too!
